@startuml
!include ../../common/style.puml
title Two-phase invocation — class generation, then explicit A2C run
participant "Caller" as C
participant "DeveloperPlatform\nWorkflow (G2C)" as G
participant "P0" as P
participant "SDLCWorkflow\n(A2C)" as W
== Phase 1 — class file ==
C -> G : generate(GeneratorRequest{a2c_inherited, scaffold})
G -> P : bootstrap(scaffold, config{a2c.enabled})
P --> G : ScaffoldResult{dev_request}
G --> C : GeneratorResult{generated_files, scaffold_result}
note over C : no Terraform or CI/CD exists yet
== Phase 2 — artifacts ==
C -> W : execute(DevRequest, config)
W --> C : DevRequest{generated_code, generated_iac,\ngenerated_cicd, critic_report}
@enduml
